status reading
  ok   clean STATUS and 3 passes: no problems
  ok   "Not attempted" item: refused
  ok   "did not attempt": refused
  ok   ordinary use of "time limit"/"quota" is not a usage reason: - the time limit of the scene check is 240 s
  ok   ordinary use of "time limit"/"quota" is not a usage reason: - the quota of lane widths per arm is 3
  ok   refused: hit the time limit
  ok   refused: will do next round
  ok   "never tried": refused
  ok   "tried ... blocked by ...": allowed
  ok   usage/time reason refused: "Pass 3 not done (usage window)"
  ok   usage/time reason refused: "stopped because of the usage limit"
  ok   usage/time reason refused: "ran out of tokens"
  ok   usage/time reason refused: "running out of time"
  ok   usage/time reason refused: "context window nearly full"
  ok   usage/time reason refused: "hit the rate limit"
  ok   usage/time reason refused: "token budget"
  ok   usage/time reason refused: "no time left"
  ok   2 passes, no residual-only line: refused
  ok   2 passes + a residual-only-unfixable line: allowed
  ok   residual-only line too short (under 40 chars): refused
  ok   usage wording in FAULTS.md: refused
  ok   usage words inside an HTML comment (the template) are not read
method-change rule
  ok   fewer than 3 rounds: no rule
