  ok   the last round improved: no refusal
  ok   the round before improved: no refusal
  ok   lower-is-better metric (failed assertions) worsening twice: refusal
  ok   lower-is-better improving: no refusal
  ok   parseRounds reads "k=v" and "k v" and P/T values
